WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Here’s a trick for long words.

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.930
Say the word and listen for the strong beat.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:06.950
Be-GIN.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:14.250
If the beat is on the last part, and it ends in one vowel and one consonant, double the consonant:

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.470
beginning.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:19.140
VIS-it has its beat at the front, so no double:

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:20.480
visiting.
